  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" width=\"441\" height=\"129\"></a></strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新 Discord 服务器！用于私人支持和更新通知。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Create: Pillager Arise (Structures)</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">为您的我的世界世界带来全新体验，引入了</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>机械化掠夺者堡垒</strong></span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> 以及</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>工程化哨站</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">，将 Create 模组的创造力与掠夺者致命的巧思融为一体。这些新结构绝非普通的掠夺者哨站&mdash;这些基地已通过复杂的机械装置、自动化防御系统和巧妙的陷阱进行了加固，即使是经验丰富的冒险者也将面临严峻挑战。&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">别忘了在我的主页查看我的其他模组！</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">此模组现由 Mei_Xiao_gong（首席开发者）负责</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/977/pill.png\" alt=\"pill\" width=\"230\" height=\"230\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/978/638598725500886388.webp\" alt=\"create\" width=\"231\" height=\"231\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">下载 Create 模组：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a></span></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">想要更激烈的战斗吗？下载：</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagers-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">掠夺者的枪</a></span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/956/28/pillagers-spawned-on-my-base-v0-qg3r7317xebb1.webp\" alt=\"pillager\" width=\"580\" height=\"461\"></span></span></p>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/949/805/create-mod-minecraft.jpg\" alt=\"create mod\" width=\"1200\" height=\"640\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">做好准备</span>，迎接策略性突袭的考验，您的战斗技巧和对机械的理解都将接受检验！</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>丰厚战利品</strong>:</span> 成功突袭这些加固的基地以获取稀有战利品，包括 Create 模组的材料、蓝图和组件，可用于强化您的建筑。 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/955/995/steam_engine.webp\" alt=\"steam\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1057/896/minecraft__1.png\" alt=\"catahrdral\" width=\"2158\" height=\"1091\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">玩法介绍：</span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>探索世界</strong>: </span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">在世界各处随机生成的升级掠夺者结构中搜寻它们，从简单的机械化哨站到宏伟复杂的堡垒应有尽有。</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>&nbsp;\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">安装步骤：</span></h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>安装 Create 模组</strong>:</span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">此模组依赖</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Create 模组</strong></span>，<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">请</span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">确保其已正确安装并运行。</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>下载 Pillager Arise (Structures)</strong>:</span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">将模组文件放入 <code>.minecraft/mods</code> 文件夹中。</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>启动我的世界</strong>: </span><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">开始游戏，尽情探索这些复杂的全新掠夺者堡垒和哨站吧！</span></h1>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/324/kagud6s.png\" alt=\"forge\" width=\"164\" height=\"164\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">仅限 Forge：</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.19.2</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.20.1</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/904/291/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模组使用 IntelliJ 开发：</span></h1>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h1>产品免责声明：本产品非官方我的世界产品。未经 Mojang 或微软批准，也不与其关联。</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
